  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cwædon, gyf him hundred bedrife tród on oðer hundred, þæt mon cyðe ðam hundredesmen, ⁊ he ðonne ðær midfare.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">We have further declared, that if one hundred follows up a track into another hundred, notice shall be given to the chief official of the latter, and he shall then take part in the search.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Etiam (Amplius) diximus, si hundredum minet uestigium in aliud hundredum, ut notificetur hominibus illius (ipsius) hundredi, et ipsi (idem) cum eo uadant.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
